-- Publisher prices of the curated series (column from 20261025000100).
-- Researched on 2026-10-24 by one agent per batch of 10 series (publisher
-- pages first, then Manga-news, Nautiljon, BnF or a major retailer showing
-- the fixed price), each batch fact-checked by a second agent (18 prices
-- corrected, mostly outdated legal-deposit prices). Regular edition, most
-- recent volume. 216 of 224 series priced ; the others stay null
-- (the app then uses the publisher's usual price, or says it is unknown).
-- Matched on the exact title of the shared curated row ; never touches a
-- reader's own series.
